    <dialog class="guide-dialog" id="guide-dialog" aria-labelledby="guide-title" tabindex="-1">
      <div class="guide-card">
        <header class="guide-header">
          <div>
            <p>HOW TO USE APOCALYPSE</p>
            <h2 id="guide-title">You choose. Apocalypse manages.</h2>
            <span>A clear path from idea to protected position.</span>
          </div>
          <button class="guide-close" id="guide-close" type="button" aria-label="Close how-to guide">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 10 10M15 5 5 15" /></svg>
          </button>
        </header>

        <div class="guide-scroll">
          <section class="guide-mission" aria-label="Your role and Apocalypse's role">
            <p class="guide-section-label">THE WHOLE IDEA</p>
            <div class="guide-role-grid">
              <article data-role="investor">
                <span class="guide-role-icon" aria-hidden="true">YOU</span>
                <div><small>YOUR DECISION</small><strong>Choose the companies</strong><p>Select Buy or Sell and confirm only the stocks you want in your portfolio.</p></div>
              </article>
              <article data-role="apocalypse">
                <span class="guide-role-icon" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
                <div><small>APOCALYPSE EXECUTION</small><strong>Manage the complexity</strong><p>Size, leverage, entry timing and protection are calculated and managed for you.</p></div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="guide-journey" aria-labelledby="guide-journey-title">
            <div class="guide-section-heading">
              <div><p class="guide-section-label">YOUR INVESTING LOOP</p><h3 id="guide-journey-title">Four steps. You stay in control.</h3></div>
              <span>01&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;04</span>
            </div>
            <div class="guide-steps">
              <article data-tone="alpha">
                <span class="guide-step-number">01</span>
                <div><small>DISCOVER</small><h4>Start with DAILY IDEAS</h4><p>See the 10 strongest opportunities selected from a scan of 600+ tradable companies, with Buy and Sell ideas ranked together. Trend, fundamentals, company news and AI-supported reasoning are combined into one ranked shortlist.</p></div>
                <span class="guide-step-state">RESEARCH</span>
              </article>
              <article data-tone="choice">
                <span class="guide-step-number">02</span>
                <div><small>DECIDE</small><h4>Choose Buy or Sell</h4><p>Tap an idea or enter any ticker yourself. Read the conviction, price view, assessment and risks, then confirm only if you want Apocalypse to act.</p></div>
                <span class="guide-step-state">YOUR MOVE</span>
              </article>
              <article data-tone="manage">
                <span class="guide-step-number">03</span>
                <div><small>EXECUTE</small><h4>Apocalypse takes over</h4><p>Apocalypse calculates the position size within a 40% total margin limit and up to 1:5 leverage. It stages the entry, waits for acceptable prices and protects the position with a volatility-based stop that can tighten as the trade progresses.</p></div>
                <span class="guide-step-state">MANAGED</span>
              </article>
              <article data-tone="monitor">
                <span class="guide-step-number">04</span>
                <div><small>MONITOR</small><h4>Follow everything in one place</h4><p>Track portfolio value, open profit and loss, invested capital, margin use, waiting entries, Buy and Sell positions, sector mix and stop protection. When you choose to close, Apocalypse manages the exit.</p></div>
                <span class="guide-step-state">LIVE</span>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="guide-alpha-card" aria-labelledby="guide-alpha-title">
            <div class="guide-alpha-mark" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</div>
            <div>
              <p class="guide-section-label">DAILY IDEAS</p>
              <h3 id="guide-alpha-title">A shortlist, not an automatic trade</h3>
              <p>The scheduled daily scan gives you a researched starting point. Long ideas are shown in green, Short ideas in red, and conviction in gold. Running a scan or viewing a proposal never places a trade&mdash;only your confirmation can add a company.</p>
              <div class="guide-color-key" aria-label="DAILY IDEAS color key">
                <span data-color="long"><i></i>Long opportunity</span>
                <span data-color="short"><i></i>Short opportunity</span>
                <span data-color="conviction"><i></i>Conviction</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="guide-guardrails" aria-label="Portfolio guardrails">
            <article><span>10</span><div><strong>Companies maximum</strong><small>Buy and Sell positions combined</small></div></article>
            <article><span>2</span><div><strong>Per sector</strong><small>Automatic concentration guardrail</small></div></article>
            <article><span>40%</span><div><strong>Margin ceiling</strong><small>Across managed positions</small></div></article>
            <article><span>5&times;</span><div><strong>Maximum exposure</strong><small>Up to 1:5 leverage</small></div></article>
          </section>

          <p class="guide-disclaimer"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span> Apocalypse provides research and disciplined execution, not certainty. Market prices can move against any position, and you remain in control of which companies enter or leave the portfolio.</p>
        </div>

        <footer class="guide-footer">
          <a class="guide-see-video" href="https://youtube.com/shorts/RT5mpLBdEuw?feature=share" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&#9654;</span> See video
          </a>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </dialog>

